  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Research and Evidence for the East Africa region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the generation of new evidence and knowledge in East Africa (Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda, Rwanda, Ethiopia and Somalia, Sudan and South Sudan) in order to enable the design and implementation of smarter, more effective development programmes which achieve better outcomes for poor and vulnerable people in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
